QuestGuidance.Register("en",36,{
[1121]="700584F8\n1\tAdvance with the dwarf army\tPrince Durin of the Longbeards is ready to lead the charge on Gundabad. You should advance with the dwarf army!\n2\tDefeat the Beasts of Slaughter\tGorgar's trap has been sprung, and you must now fight in his arena or perish. You should defeat Gorgar's Beasts of Slaughter.\n3\tDefeat Gorgar and Ránulur\tYou have defeated the beasts, but Gorgar now intends to fight you himself! You must now face Gorgar the Ruthless and Ránulur, Chieftain of Wargs in the arena!\n",
[1122]="70058503\n1\tAdvance with the dwarf army\tPrince Durin of the Longbeards is ready to lead the charge on Gundabad. You should advance with the dwarf army!\n2\tDefeat the Beasts of Slaughter\tGorgar's trap has been sprung, and you must now fight in his arena or perish. You should defeat Gorgar's Beasts of Slaughter.\n3\tDefeat Gorgar and Ránulur\tYou have defeated the beasts, but Gorgar now intends to fight you himself! You must now face Gorgar the Ruthless and Ránulur, Chieftain of Wargs in the arena!\n",
[1123]="70058500\n1\tAdvance with the dwarf army\tPrince Durin of the Longbeards is ready to lead the charge on Gundabad. You should advance with the dwarf army!\n2\tDefeat the Beasts of Slaughter\tGorgar's trap has been sprung, and you must now fight in his arena or perish. You should defeat Gorgar's Beasts of Slaughter.\n3\tDefeat Gorgar and Ránulur\tYou have defeated the beasts, but Gorgar now intends to fight you himself! You must now face Gorgar the Ruthless and Ránulur, Chieftain of Wargs in the arena!\n",
[1124]="7005784D\n1\tCatch amethyst fireflies (total: 12)\tYou can find amethyst fireflies in the Grimwater from gloaming till dawn. You should collect fireflies for the wedding planner in Minas Tirith.\n2\tTalk to Merilien\tThe wedding planner Merilien is located in Minas Tirith. Return to Minas Tirith with the firefly-filled lanterns.\n3\tPlace amethyst firefly lanterns ([see journal]/4)\tThe alcove and the Houses of Healing are located on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith. You should place two amethyst firefly lanterns in each location for the wedding planner.\n",
[1125]="700546CE\n1\tDestroy the statues and shrines to Sauron\tStatues and shrines to Sauron can be found at Amon Fuin in Parth Daenath. You should destroy the statues and shrines to Sauron.\n2\tDestroy statues of the Dark Lord (total: 6)\030Destroy shrines to Sauron (total: 10)\tStatues and shrines to Sauron can be found at Amon Fuin in Parth Daenath. You should destroy the statues and shrines to Sauron.\n3\tCompleted\tDestroyed many statues and shrines of Sauron's worship at Amon Fuin.\n",
[1126]="700546CB\n1\tSearch coffers for supplies\tCoffers can be found at Amon Fuin in Parth Daenath. You should search the coffers for supplies.\n2\tSearch coffers for supplies (total: 10)\tCoffers can be found at Amon Fuin in Parth Daenath. You should search the coffers for supplies.\n3\tStore the supplies in a chest at Echad-in-Edhil\tThe supplies that you have found should be brought back to Echad-in-Edhil and stored in a chest.\n",
[1127]="700546CD\n1\tDefeat Amon Fuin's forces\tMany foes gather at Amon Fuin in Parth Daenath. You should defeat Amon Fuin's forces.\n2\tDefeat Mordorrim at Amon Fuin (total: 12)\030Defeat Black Númenóreans at Amon Fuin (total: 6)\030Defeat Mátrothog\tMany foes gather at Amon Fuin in Parth Daenath. You should defeat Amon Fuin's forces.\n3\tCompleted\tDefeated many foes at Amon Fuin.\n",
[1128]="7004CE98\n1\tCollect berries (total: 5)\030Collect firewood (total: 8)\tThe camps of the Easterling refugees are in the hills east of Dale. You should help the refugees by gathering firewood and blue berries for them.\n2\tBring the supplies to Enkárvo\tEnkárvo can be found in the Dorwinion camp, in the hills east of Dale. You should bring the berries and firewood you gathered back to Enkárvo.\n",
[1129]="7004CE8E\n1\tSearch for Chayasír potsherds (total: 16)\tYou should search for Chayasír potsherds in the soil throughout the Dale-lands.\n2\tReturn to Sangemêkh Turáh\tYou should return to Sangemêkh Turáh, who can be found in the Dorwinion refugee camp, in the hills east of Dale.\n",
[1130]="7004CE95\n1\tDefeat wolves (total: 12)\tYou should defeat wolves in the areas around the refugee encampments, east and across the river from Dale.\n2\tReturn to Komúsi\tYou should return to Komúsi, who can be found in the Dorwinion camp, in the hills east of Dale.\n",
[1131]="70041780\n1\tDefeat city toughs and scoundrels (total: 10)\tThe ruffians can be found in the abandoned district to the north-east of Tol Ciryarani. You should defeat the ruffians who are harbouring Lorvegil.\n2\tTalk to Thandor\tThandor, the Gondorian Captain, can be located in the market east of Tol Ciryarani. You should speak with Thandor.\n",
[1132]="7004D065\n1\tTalk to Sírithon\tYou should talk to Sírithon, who can be found in Loeglond.\n2\tTake inventory of supplies (total: 10)\030Take inventory of provisions (total: 6)\tYou should inventory the supplies and rations in Loeglond.\n3\tTalk to Sírithon\tSírithon can be found at Loeglond. You should speak with Sírithon about the various missing supplies.\n",
[1133]="7002F062\n1\tGet Zerlúk to resume his account\tZerlúk is in the Dead Orc Glade, in the middle of giving you his account of what happened there.\n2\tGet Zerlúk to resume his account\tZerlúk is in the Dead Orc Glade, in the middle of giving you his account of what happened there.\n",
[1134]="70032BF1\n1\tReturn to Mögr with a full account of Zelem-melek\tForeman Mögr is at the Twenty-first Hall. You should return to Mögr in the Twenty-first Hall and correct his views of Zelem-melek.\n",
[1135]="70018C1E\n1\tGather cask of ale\tThe lost ale kegs can be found south-west of Bree's Festival grounds, probably just off the Greenway near Thornley's Farm. Wim Wheatsheaf asked you to recover a keg of ale for the annual Yule festival tasting.\n2\tBring the ale-cask to Wim Wheatsheaf\tWim Wheatsheaf is at the Festival Grounds in Bree. Wim Wheatsheaf will be pleased to receive the keg containing the ale for the Yule festival tasting.\n",
[1136]="700001E8\n1\tTalk to Glóin\tGlóin is at the dwarves' mountain camp north of Rivendell. Elrond has asked you to speak to Glóin of a new council against Angmar.\n",
[1137]="7001D0C8\n1\tEscort the wounded Elf to safety\tAid the fallen Malledhrim warrior in his escape from the war-torn fortifications of Gathbúrz, back towards Thangúlhad.\n2\tTalk to Handelen in Thangúlhad\tHandelen is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz. You should inform Handelen of the aid you lent to the wounded Elf-warrior.\n",
[1138]="7004A8D1\n1\tFollow the trail of the Silent One's blood deeper into Rath Cail\tThe trail of the Silent One's blood leads deeper into Rath Cail. Legolas has spotted an Orc with a similar stature and bearing fleeing deeper into Rath Cail. You should follow the trail of Orkish blood and see where it leads.\n2\tTalk to Legolas in the Silent Haunt\tLegolas can be found in the Silent Haunt. You and Legolas have tracked the Silent One to what appears to be his refuge in Lhingris. The Silent One is nowhere to be found, but curious items have been laid in the cave.\n",
[1139]="7002D3DF\n1\tSearch for relics in the Vault of Durin (total: 4)\tThe Vault of Durin lies directly south of the little encampment in Lamab-dûm, in the Great Delving. You should find the Vault of Durin and see if it is as promising as its name sounds.\n2\tReturn to Swerthir in Lamab-dûm\tSwerthir is at the small dwarf-encampment in Lamab-dûm in the Great Delving. You should return to Swerthir and tell him what you have learned about the current state of the Vault of Durin.\n",
[1140]="700076BE\n1\tRead Naerandir's book for guidance\030Obtain the left half of the Barrow-key\030Obtain the right half of the Barrow-key\tThe Great Barrow is at the crest of the hill beyond the small encampment. The first key fragment is guarded by two wights in the Great Barrow maze. The second key fragment is held by a Gaunt-lord elsewhere in the Great Barrow. Naerandir asked you to enter the Great Barrow, Orthongroth to rid the tomb of evil. He provided you with a book to aid you on your adventure. The first half of the key is found in the Great Barrow -- Maze instance space, while the second half is found in the Great Barrow -- Thadur instance space.\n2\tAssemble the key at the Barrow's Forge\030Refer to Naeradir's Book for help\tA forge lay before a great door within the Barrows. It is here that the key will need to be reforged. It will take no skill, but certainly time, to reforge the key. Consult Naerandir's book should you ever become confused about how to reforge the key.\n",
[1141]="7000BFC9\n1\tDefeat Thaurlach\tGlathlírel stands vigilant outside of Gorthban. Eimyr has instructed you to find Glathlírel and aid her against Thaurlach, a Balrog of Morgoth.\n2\tTalk to Iorelen\tIorelen is at Iorelen's Camp. You have slain Thaurlach and should tell Iorelen of your deeds.\n",
[1142]="7006B67C\n1\tFind the first fishing spot\tThe first fishing spot is on a bridge crossing a stream east of Arwáth. You should go there and try catching a fish.\n2\tCatch a fish at the first spot\tYou have found the first fishing spot Zildug described. You should equip your fishing rod and see if it is as good a place to fish as Zildug says.\n3\tFind the second fishing spot\tThe second fishing spot is south along the same stream as the first. You should go there and try catching a fish.\n4\tCatch a fish at the second spot\tYou have found the second fishing spot Zildug described. You should cast a line and see if it is as good a place to fish as Zildug says.\n5\tFind the third fishing spot\tThe third fishing spot is a dock on the Ikorbân, far to the south-east past the Wrackwade. You should go there and try catching a fish.\n6\tCatch a fish at the third spot\tYou have found the third fishing spot Zildug described. You should throw the old bait and hook and see if it is as good a place to fish as Zildug says.\n7\tReturn to Zildug in Iridír\tYou caught a fish at each of the three locations Zildug recommended. You should return to Iridír and show your catch to the fisherman.\n",
[1143]="7004A3A4\n1\tHelp Kurtil up\tThe slave Kurtil is lying on the southern edge of the Udûn basin, up atop a wooden structure. You should help Kurtil up off the ground.\n2\tTalk to Kurtil\tThe slave Kurtil stands on the southern edge of the Udûn basin, up atop a wooden structure. You should talk to Kurtil some more.\n3\tYou should search for more signal flags south of the Udûn basin, on the road that leads up toward Mornaur.\t\n4\tFind Kurtil up the road\tNow that you have inspected more signal flags, you should look for Kurtil southward on the road that leads to Mornaur.\n",
[1144]="70047860\n1\tTalk to Galathir in the House of Remedies\tGalathir can be found in the House of Remedies within the Masters' Tier of Minas Tirith (After-battle). Ioreth has asked you to speak with Galathir for she fears he might mislead a young apprentice in his tutelage.\n2\tTalk to Mílgamel in the House of Remedies\tMílgamel can be found in the House of Remedies within the Masters' Tier of Minas Tirith (After-battle). Galathir has given his apprentice, Mílgamel, a daunting task, and he has asked that you aid her in completing it.\n3\tMeet Mílgamel near the remains of the Great Bridge in Osgiliath (After-battle)\tMílgamel can be found along the central causeway in Osgiliath (After-battle). Mílgamel has asked you to meet her in Osgiliath before embarking on her survey of Ithilien.\n4\tTalk to Mílgamel in Osgiliath (After-battle)\tMílgamel can be found on the central causeway in Osgiliath (After-battle). You have found Mílgamel and should now speak to her about her plans for surveying Ithilien.\n5\tSurvey the Houses of Healing in Osgiliath\030Survey the roadway into Imlad Morgul\030Survey the ruins of Bâr Aroth in Ithilien\030Survey the ruins of Aelin Veren in Ithilien\030Survey the island fortress of Cair Andros\tMílgamel can be found at your side or summoned by horn. Mílgamel has asked you to aid her in surveying the greater lands of Ithilien. You should bring her to each location she mentioned and confer with her once there.\n6\tEscort Mílgamel to Henneth Annûn\tMílgamel can be found at your side or summoned by horn. Mílgamel has finished her initial survey and has asked to be escorted to Henneth Annûn. You should speak to her once you arrive at Henneth Annûn.\n7\tTalk to Mílgamel at Henneth Annûn\tMílgamel can be found at Henneth Annûn. You have escorted Mílgamel to Henneth Annûn and should now speak to her about what is to be done next.\n",
[1145]="70015E0D\n1\tDefeat crebain (total: 14)\tThe crebain may be found in the valley far to the east of Gwingris. Thaliondir has asked you to go forth and defeat Saruman's craban-spies.\n2\tTalk to Thaliondir in Gwingris\tThaliondir is at Gwingris, far to the west of the craban-nests. You should return to Thaliondir with news of your success.\n",
[1146]="7006C4E3\n1\tSpeak with Sûkal\tNingêna asked you to speak with the Khûdi envoy in the encampment. She cannot spare her time or any of her people to address the envoy's needs. You can find him not far from her location.\n2\tSûkal provided you a coin and a general direction to the road south over the Wrackwade to reach Jirush, and a man named Sigênik. Sigênik is a contact for the rebels in Khûd Zagin.\t\n",
[1147]="7004E4CC\n1\tMeet Tuhâl in Dale\tTuhâl is travelling to Dale to meet with Queen Erna and King Bard. You should meet Tuhâl in Dale.\n2\tTalk to Queen Erna\tQueen Erna and King Bard can be found in Dale. You should talk to Queen Erna.\n3\tTalk to King Bard\tQueen Erna and King Bard can be found in Dale. You should talk to Queen Erna.\n4\tTalk to Tuhâl\tThe King has decided to set aside land for the Easterling refugees! You should discuss the good news with Tuhâl!\n",
[1148]="700604B8\n1\tTalk to Cariad\tCariad wishes to introduce you to Erlys, the woman who leads this group of Dunlending refugees. He waits in front of the Cuan-lûth Refuge.\n2\tTalk to Cariad\tCariad waits for you in front of the Cuan-lûth Refuge.\n",
[1149]="70071D93\n1\tSpeak with Mizâdi outside the Shorakhúna in Zajâna when you are ready\tSpeak with Mizâdi outside the Shorakhúna in Zajâna when you are ready to go.\n2\tSpeak with Mizâdi outside the Shorakhúna in Zajâna\tSpeak with Mizâdi outside the Shorakhúna in Zajâna.\n",
[1150]="7006AC14\n1\tIntroduce yourself to the important-looking dwarf standing in Khôltekh's entry room\tIntroduce yourself to the important-looking dwarf standing in Khôltekh's entry room.\n2\tListen to the conversation between Khôltekh and Inîk Jewel-brow\tListen to the conversation between Khôltekh and Inîk Jewel-brow.\n3\tSpeak with Khôltekh about Inîk Jewel-brow\tSpeak with Khôltekh about Inîk Jewel-brow.\n4\tListen to Khôltekh explain his plans for the Umbar-môkh\tListen to Khôltekh explain his plans for the Umbar-môkh.\n5\tListen to Khôltekh explain his plans for the Umbar-môkh\tListen to Khôltekh explain his plans for the Umbar-môkh.\n6\tSpeak with Khôltekh about his plans for the Umbar-môkh\tSpeak with Khôltekh about his plans for the Umbar-môkh.\n",
[1151]="7000E39C\n1\tDefeat the Caged Red-Fang\tThe Warg is being held captive in the northern part of Kauppa-kohta. Valtteri, the Lossoth Hunt-leader, has instructed you to defeat the Warg his party has captured to earn the right to hunt with the Lossoth.\n2\tTalk to Valtteri\tValtteri is in the northern part of Kauppa-kohta, the Lossoth trading post. You should speak with Valtteri again, now that you have defeated the Warg.\n",
[1152]="700430B1\n1\tDourhand surveyors sent by Skorgrím Dourhand never returned from their mission to map the tunnels of Goblin-town. If you can find their maps, it could be you will learn the layout of the caverns beneath the Misty Mountains into which Bingo has fallen.\t\n2\tDourhand surveyors sent by Skorgrím Dourhand never returned from their mission to map the tunnels of Goblin-town. If you can find their maps, it could be you will learn the layout of the caverns beneath the Misty Mountains into which Bingo has fallen.\t\n3\tBring the map of mountain-tunnels to Spalvi in the Southern High Pass\tSpalvi Dourhand told you he would meet you on an overlook in the Southern High Pass area of the Misty Mountains once you recovered some useful maps from the surveyors lost in Goblin-town.\n4\tFind Willem Whisker somewhere within the gauredain camp at Erforgh Cleft\tWillem Whisker has gone in search of Bingo in the Erforgh Cleft in the south-east corner of the Southern High Pass, and Spalvi wants you to make sure he is all right.\n5\tTalk to Spalvi in the Southern High Pass\tSpalvi Dourhand is on an overlook in the Southern High Pass area of the Misty Mountains, north-west of Erforgh Cleft.\n6\tTalk to Spalvi just outside Glóin's camp in the Western Bruinen Source area\tSpalvi wanted to meet up with you just outside Glóin's Camp in the Western Bruinen Source area of the Misty Mountains.\n",
})
